=== Rack/Link Pattern ===

Creating linked list with links:
List values: 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> end

Creating game entities:

Entity relationships:
Player (HP: 100) -> targets Goblin
Goblin (HP: 50) -> targets Player
Orc (HP: 80) -> targets Player

Applying damage:
Goblin health: 30
Player health: 90

Removing defeated enemy:
Goblin deleted
Player's target cleared by the delete

=== Key Benefits ===
- No lifetime parameters
- A link can live in a field; a reference can't
- A dead link never exists, so reads need no check
- The rack owns the nodes; links are one machine word
